*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*FormatVersion:	"4.3"
*FileVersion:	"2.0.0"
*LanguageVersion: English 
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName:	"PTPJETII.PPD"
*Manufacturer:	"Pentax"
*Product:	"(ESP Ghostscript)"
*cupsVersion:	1.1
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsModelNumber:  2
*cupsFilter:	"application/vnd.cups-raster 10 rastertopocketjet"
*ModelName:     "Pentax PocketJet II"
*ShortNickName: "Pentax PocketJet II"
*NickName:      "Pentax PocketJet II v2.0.0 (CUPS)"
*PSVersion:	"(3010.000) 550"
*LanguageLevel:	"3"
*ColorDevice:	False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem:	False
*Throughput:	"1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*VariablePaperSize: True
*TTRasterizer:	Type42
*cupsICCProfile ../Gray Profile: "/Library/Printers/Pentax/Profiles/PocketJet.icc"
*APPrinterIconPath: "/Library/Printers/Pentax/Printer Icons/PocketJet.icns"

*UIConstraints: *PageSize PerfLetter *FormFeedMode FixedPage
*UIConstraints: *PageSize PerfLetter *FormFeedMode NoFeed
*UIConstraints: *FormFeedMode FixedPage *PageSize PerfLetter 
*UIConstraints: *FormFeedMode NoFeed *PageSize PerfLetter 
*UIConstraints: *PageSize PerfA4 *FormFeedMode FixedPage
*UIConstraints: *PageSize PerfA4 *FormFeedMode NoFeed
*UIConstraints: *FormFeedMode FixedPage *PageSize PerfA4 
*UIConstraints: *FormFeedMode NoFeed *PageSize PerfA4 

*UIConstraints: *PageSize ContinuousLetter *FormFeedMode FixedPage
*UIConstraints: *PageSize ContinuousLetter *FormFeedMode EndOfPage
*UIConstraints: *FormFeedMode FixedPage *PageSize ContinuousLetter 
*UIConstraints: *FormFeedMode EndOfPage *PageSize ContinuousLetter 
*UIConstraints: *PageSize ContinuousLetter *ExtraFeed
*UIConstraints: *ExtraFeed *PageSize ContinuousLetter 

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Letter
*PageSize Letter:	"<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize ContinuousLetter/Infinite:	"<</PageSize[612 7200]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize PerfLetter/Letter (Perforated Roll):	"<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal:	"<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A4:		"<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize PerfA4/A4 (Perforated Roll):	"<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Letter
*PageRegion Letter:	"<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion ContinuousLetter/Infinite: "<</PageSize[612 7200]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion PerfLetter/Letter (Perforated Roll): "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal:	"<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A4:		"<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion PerfA4/A4 (Perforated Roll):	"<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: Letter 
*ImageableArea Letter:                              "10.32 4.8 601.68 772.8"
*ImageableArea ContinuousLetter/Infinite:         "10.32 0 601.68 7200"
*ImageableArea PerfLetter/Letter (Perforated Roll): "10.32 33.6 601.68 746.4"
*ImageableArea Legal:                               "10.32 4.8 601.68 988.8"
*ImageableArea A4:                                  "9.6 4.8 585.6 822.24"
*ImageableArea PerfA4/A4 (Perforated Roll):         "9.6 33.6 585.6 796.08"

*DefaultPaperDimension: Letter
*PaperDimension Letter:     "612 792"
*PaperDimension ContinuousLetter/Infinite:     "612 7200"
*PaperDimension PerfLetter/Letter (Perforated Roll): "612 792"
*PaperDimension Legal:      "612 1008"
*PaperDimension A4:         "595 842"
*PaperDimension PerfA4/A4 (Perforated Roll):     "595 842"

*MaxMediaWidth:  "612"
*MaxMediaHeight: "7200"
*HWMargins:      10.32 19.26 10.32 4.86
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*ParamCustomPageSize Width:        1 points 72 612
*ParamCustomPageSize Height:       2 points 72 7200
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset:  3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation:  5 int 0 0

*OpenUI *Resolution/Output Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 300
*Resolution 300/300 DPI: "<</HWResolution[300 300]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *Density/Print Density: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *Density
*DefaultDensity: 7
*Density 1/1 (Lightest):        "<</MediaWeight 25>>setpagedevice"
*Density 2/2 (Very light):      "<</MediaWeight 50>>setpagedevice"
*Density 3/3 (Light):           "<</MediaWeight 75>>setpagedevice"
*Density 4/4 (Lighter):         "<</MediaWeight 100>>setpagedevice"
*Density 5/5 (Normal Light):    "<</MediaWeight 125>>setpagedevice"
*Density 6/6 (Normal):          "<</MediaWeight 150>>setpagedevice"
*Density 7/7 (Normal Dark):     "<</MediaWeight 175>>setpagedevice"
*Density 8/8 (Dark):            "<</MediaWeight 200>>setpagedevice"
*Density 9/9 (Very dark):       "<</MediaWeight 225>>setpagedevice"
*Density 10/10 (Darkest):       "<</MediaWeight 250>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Density

*OpenUI *FormFeedMode/Form Feed Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *FormFeedMode
*DefaultFormFeedMode: FixedPage
*FormFeedMode FixedPage/Fixed page:     "<</AdvanceMedia 1>>setpagedevice"
*FormFeedMode EndOfPage/End-of-Page:    "<</AdvanceMedia 2>>setpagedevice"
*FormFeedMode NoFeed/No Feed:           "<</AdvanceMedia 3>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *FormFeedMode

*OpenUI *ExtraFeed/Extra Feed (No Feed Mode only): PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *ExtraFeed
*DefaultExtraFeed: 1inch
*ExtraFeed none/None:               "<</AdvanceDistance 0>>setpagedevice"
*ExtraFeed halfinch/1/2 inch:       "<</AdvanceDistance 36>>setpagedevice"
*ExtraFeed 1inch/1 inch:            "<</AdvanceDistance 72>>setpagedevice"
*ExtraFeed 1-halfinch/1-1/2 inch:   "<</AdvanceDistance 108>>setpagedevice"
*ExtraFeed 2inch/2 inches:          "<</AdvanceDistance 144>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ExtraFeed

*OpenUI *MirrorPrint/Mirror Print: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *MirrorPrint
*DefaultMirrorPrint: False
*MirrorPrint False:              "<</MirrorPrint false>>setpagedevice"
*MirrorPrint True:               "<</MirrorPrint true>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *MirrorPrint

*OpenUI *NegativePrint/Negative Print: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *NegativePrint
*DefaultNegativePrint: False
*NegativePrint False:              "<</NegativePrint false>>setpagedevice"
*NegativePrint True:               "<</NegativePrint true>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *NegativePrint

*OpenUI *CCMode/2-ply Mode: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *CCMode
*DefaultCCMode: False
*CCMode False:              "<</cupsMediaType 1>>setpagedevice"
*CCMode True:               "<</cupsMediaType 2>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *CCMode

